      ],
      "span_end": 5448,
      "span_start": 5323,
      "window_policy_version": "v4-zizhitongjian-192-anti-nepotism-atomic-v1"
    },
    {
      "content_hash": "134a05cf0be23fdf5a6db5d1b85d1cdfc2e8c8781bd757e865b00e6f2d32a810",
      "content_version": "revision:2693692:0829bbb690d227c10fe0f9bc7761f68e53dc6af50719375c8822920a03f1bc63",
      "context_after": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "document_id": "SCD-FE15066100337FD8CF4C",
      "linked_passages": [],
      "locator": "xintangshu-096-anti-nepotism:2542-2644",
      "overlap_group": null,
      "passage_id": "SP-9588FE5F704EC9A48321",
      "passage_kind": "atomic",
      "raw_text": "次子遺愛，誕率無學，有武力。尚高陽公主，爲右衞將軍。公主，帝所愛，故禮與它婿絶。主驕蹇，疾遺直任嫡，遺直懼，讓爵，帝不許。主稍失愛，意怏怏。與浮屠辯機亂，帝怒，斬浮屠，殺奴婢數十人，主怨望，帝崩，哭不哀。",
      "section_heading": "房玄齡傳",
      "section_id": "xintangshu-096-anti-nepotism",
      "selection_reason": [
        "negative_search",
        "affinal_relationship",
        "ordinary_favor_vs_public_office_control"
      ],
      "span_end": 2644,
      "span_start": 2542,
      "window_policy_version": "v4-xintangshu-096-anti-nepotism-atomic-v1"
    },
    {
      "content_hash": "bcbc88f15e68e7d27fafa68a559b01a52c1786b489b3e3b678c08f95392b2f46",
      "content_version": "revision:2510432:65eebe566aab4def4b5fc7eabcec8011a53a3a12b1edce47f66851c54274eac6",
      "context_after": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "document_id": "SCD-68D2BEE29851A3A21DD1",
      "linked_passages": [],
      "locator": "zizhitongjian-192-anti-nepotism:509-760",
      "overlap_group": null,
      "passage_id": "SP-A71756F99E5E4A0C1D16",
      "passage_kind": "atomic",
      "raw_text": "己酉，上面定勳臣長孫無忌等爵邑，命陳叔達於殿下唱名示之，且曰：「朕敘卿等勳賞或未當，宜各自言。」於是諸將爭功，紛紜不已。淮安王神通曰：「臣舉兵關西，首應義旗，今房玄齡，杜如晦等專弄刀筆，功居臣上，臣竊不服。」上曰：「義旗初起，叔父雖首唱舉兵，蓋亦自營脫禍。及竇建德吞噬山東，叔父全軍覆沒；劉黑闥再合餘燼，叔父望風奔北。玄齡等運籌帷幄，坐安社稷，論功行賞，固宜居叔父之先。叔父，國之至親，朕誠無所愛，但不可以私恩濫與勳臣同賞耳！」諸將乃相謂曰：「陛下至公，雖淮安王尚無所私，吾儕何敢不安其分。」遂皆悅服。",
      "section_heading": "唐紀八",
      "section_id": "zizhitongjian-192-anti-nepotism",
