    },
    {
      "content_hash": "9402f9e7605221c243ce27211c20f31fe1cd0182ce592cef009a8207a986a22f",
      "content_version": "revision:2510432:65eebe566aab4def4b5fc7eabcec8011a53a3a12b1edce47f66851c54274eac6",
      "context_after": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "document_id": "SCD-68D2BEE29851A3A21DD1",
      "linked_passages": [],
      "locator": "zizhitongjian-192-anti-nepotism:4676-4784",
      "overlap_group": null,
      "passage_id": "SP-E61D325F4737A3DD0065",
      "passage_kind": "atomic",
      "raw_text": "涼州都督長樂王幼良，性粗暴，左右百餘人，皆無賴子弟，侵暴百姓；又與羌、胡互市。或告幼良有異志，上遣中書令宇文士及馳驛代之，並按其事。左右懼，謀劫幼良入北虜，又欲殺士及據有河西。復有告其謀者，夏，四月，癸巳，賜幼良死。",
      "section_heading": "唐紀八",
      "section_id": "zizhitongjian-192-anti-nepotism",
      "selection_reason": [
        "positive_search",
        "royal_public_power",
        "correction_control"
      ],
      "span_end": 4784,
      "span_start": 4676,
      "window_policy_version": "v4-zizhitongjian-192-anti-nepotism-atomic-v1"
    },
    {
      "content_hash": "8ababc242e89178eaf18c6b6594eaa3a39b0602ae5e1f8dfeeef5d5601980738",
      "content_version": "revision:2612199:f0bdaac66c68cb24588ee67e14e681de6dd813c44daa8d45874ac56acdd92727",
      "context_after": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "document_id": "SCD-F31ECC9FA28C8F3D24D7",
      "linked_passages": [],
      "locator": "jiutangshu-60-anti-nepotism:1032-1256",
      "overlap_group": null,
      "passage_id": "SP-F007D1A5BF442CB2DFCD",
      "passage_kind": "atomic",
      "raw_text": "貞觀元年，拜開府儀同三司，賜實封五百戶。時太宗謂諸功臣曰：「朕敘公等勳效，量定封邑，恐不能盡當，各自言。」神通曰：「義旗初起，臣率兵先至，今房玄齡、杜如晦等刀筆之人，功居第一，臣且不服。」上曰：「義旗初起，人皆有心。叔父雖率兵先至，未嘗身履行陣。山東未定，受委專征，建德南侵，全軍陷沒；及劉黑闥翻動，叔父望風而破。今計勳行賞，玄齡等有籌謀帷幄定社稷功，所以漢之蕭何，雖無汗馬，指縱推轂，故功居第一。叔父於國至親，誠無所愛，必不可緣私濫與勳臣同賞耳。",
      "section_heading": "宗室",
      "section_id": "jiutangshu-60-anti-nepotism",
